{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1044895-beaten-down-tilt","id":1044895,"title":"Beaten Down Tilt","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-06T21:57:42-08:00","id":1044895,"title":"Beaten Down Tilt","content":"What am I missing? The Beaten Down Tilt says that &quot;The character suffers bashing damage <br /> in excess of his Stamina or any amount of lethal damage&quot; This seems like every time a fight occurs the one attacking first will beat down the opponent. what am I missing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4135-blue-thomas","name":"Blue Thomas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-06T22:02:21-08:00","id":1044900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blue Thomas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1044895-beaten-down-tilt#post1044895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what am I missing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Where it says, 'Optional Rule,' and describes the purpose of the tilt. Basically, it's a way to keep all combat from being 'to the death.' When you need something from someone, or they just want to get away, or someone enters combat with a goal other than 'kill everyone,' this acts as a win condition. If you inflict Beaten Down, they give you what you wanted. If they inflict it, they manage to get away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-06T22:39:34-08:00","id":1044918,"title":"","content":"thanks for answering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4135-blue-thomas","name":"Blue Thomas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-06T23:37:14-08:00","id":1044941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blue Thomas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1044895-beaten-down-tilt#post1044895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What am I missing? The Beaten Down Tilt says that &amp;quot;The character suffers bashing damage <br /> in excess of his Stamina or any amount of lethal damage&amp;quot; This seems like every time a fight occurs the one attacking first will beat down the opponent. what am I missing?</div> </div> </div> </div>You're also missing the part where it says &quot;If one side\u2019s intent involves violence for its own sake, the other side can\u2019t surrender \u2014 not without being killed or harmed anyway. If that\u2019s the case, the aggressor\u2019s intended victims don\u2019t get the Beaten Down Tilt, and gain no benefits from surrendering.&quot; and the part where it says &quot;These rules only apply to people who would incur a break- ing point for committing (or attempting) \u201cmurder.\u201d Creatures that don\u2019t have a problem killing people in general can ignore surrender without penalty and don\u2019t have the fight beaten out of them like normal folks.&quot;<br /> <br /> So if your character is a werewolf, a Changeling, a Vampire who has taken a Bane for murder, etc, or if your opponent doesn't want anything out of the combat other than to hurt you, then you're immune to Beaten Down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-07T01:20:01-08:00","id":1044956,"title":"","content":"There's also a tactical angle here. Going first doesn't mean you hit. The gap between offensive dice-pools and Defense is a lot smaller in 2e, and it's not that hard to put attackers in the position of needing to spend WP and/or use All-out-Attack to keep away from chance-dice (or face much larger Dodge pools). Obviously contingent on the relative skills of the characters involved, but you can gamble on going defensive and wait for a good chance to risk attacking (such as if they're out of WP and have to all-out-attack just to get 1 die, you have really good odds of not being hit, and hitting them one your turn). It's not sure-fire by any means, but it's not an &quot;go first and alpha-strike for the easy win&quot; either.<br /> <br /> You also don't have to give up when hit with Beaten Down. We had a NPC try throw everything into the first hit to inflict Beaten Down thing, did 2 lethal, and one of the players opted to spend the WP to hit him back... and ended up doing 6 lethal (higher damage weapon and a lucky roll) inflicting Beaten Down and Stunned in return... prompting the NPC (who only have 7 total health anyway) to surrender rather than face 1/2 Defense and another attack, because... um... duh.<br /> <br /> So yes to everything above about when to use it, but remember that it isn't guaranteed to go to the first person to attack, and it isn't a surefire win either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-07T09:59:20-08:00","id":1045182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1044895-beaten-down-tilt?p=1044941#post1044941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You're also missing the part where it says &quot;If one side\u2019s intent involves violence for its own sake, the other side can\u2019t surrender \u2014 not without being killed or harmed anyway. If that\u2019s the case, the aggressor\u2019s intended victims don\u2019t get the Beaten Down Tilt, and gain no benefits from surrendering.&quot; and the part where it says &quot;These rules only apply to people who would incur a break- ing point for committing (or attempting) \u201cmurder.\u201d Creatures that don\u2019t have a problem killing people in general can ignore surrender without penalty and don\u2019t have the fight beaten out of them like normal folks.&quot;<br /> <br /> So if your character is a werewolf, a Changeling, a Vampire who has taken a Bane for murder, etc, or if your opponent doesn't want anything out of the combat other than to hurt you, then you're immune to Beaten Down.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is that the main rule book? I just saw the condition section.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4135-blue-thomas","name":"Blue Thomas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-07T11:09:24-08:00","id":1045230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blue Thomas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1044895-beaten-down-tilt?p=1045182#post1045182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that the main rule book? I just saw the condition section.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}